It is Saturday afternoon.
I am in my room.
Suddenly, I hear a chewing sound from the hall.
I go outside and see Moti there.
He is happily chewing one of my sandals!
I immediately clap my hands loudly.
"Moti, no!"
"Drop that!" I shout.
He looks at me but does not let go of the sandal.
"Moti, give it to me immediately," I tell him in a strict voice.
"You must not eat sandals," I explain to him.
He slowly puts the sandal on the floor.
I go forward and immediately pick it up.
Then I take his favourite toy.
"Take this," I give him that toy.
"You must chew only this toy," I say.
He catches that toy in his mouth.
He happily wags his tail again.
I look at my sandal.
Fortunately, the sandal is fine.
